_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"un-reto-superado-con-xito\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Un reto superado con éxito </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🚀</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Nivel 2 de Stellar Quest</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> ha sido una experiencia increíble, permitiéndonos explorar más a fondo las capacidades de la blockchain de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. En esta etapa, nos enfrentamos a varios desafíos que nos ayudaron a entender mejor cómo manejar cuentas, permisos y transacciones dentro del ecosistema.</span></p></div><div class=\"py-2\"><div class=\"twitter-wrapper mx-auto max-w-[520px]\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet text-center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Stellar_Chile/status/1892636179276632244\"><p>— #<!-- --> (#<!-- -->)<br></p></a></blockquote></div></div><div id=\"qu-aprendimos-en-este-nivel-1-accou\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Qué aprendimos en este nivel? 🔍</span><br><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>1. Account Merge</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Fusionando cuentas</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Esta operación nos permite eliminar una cuenta y transferir todos sus fondos a otra cuenta de destino. Para lograrlo, seguimos estos pasos:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Creamos una cuenta en el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>laboratorio de Stellar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y la cargamos con </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>XLM de prueba</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Utilizamos la cuenta proporcionada por Stellar Quest como </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>cuenta de origen</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Aplicamos la operación </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Account Merge</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> con la </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>llave pública de la nueva cuenta</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> como destino.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Firmamos la transacción con nuestra </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>llave privada de Stellar Quest</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"2-manage-data-agregando-datos-arbit\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>2. Manage Data</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Agregando datos arbitrarios</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Este reto nos enseñó a agregar información dentro de una cuenta de Stellar mediante la operación </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Manage Data</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. Definimos una variable y un valor dentro de la cuenta, lo que permite manejar datos personalizados en la blockchain.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Pasos clave:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Agregamos fondos a la cuenta del Quest.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Copiamos las llaves proporcionadas.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Definimos una variable \"Nombre\" con el valor \"Pau\".</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Firmamos con nuestra </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>llave privada del Quest</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"3-set-options-configuracin-avanzada\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>3. Set Options</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Configuración avanzada de cuentas</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Aquí exploramos cómo modificar opciones clave de una cuenta, como la </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Home Domain</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, firmas requeridas y permisos dentro de la blockchain.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Pasos importantes:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Agregamos fondos y copiamos las llaves.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Editamos el archivo </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>stellar.toml</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Glitch.com</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, ingresando nuestra llave pública.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Configuramos la </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Home Domain</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> sin incluir '/' ni 'https'.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Firmamos con la llave privada de Stellar Quest.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"py-2\"><div class=\"twitter-wrapper mx-auto max-w-[520px]\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet text-center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Stellar_Chile/status/1892636179276632244\"><p>— #<!-- --> (#<!-- -->)<br></p></a></blockquote></div></div><div id=\"4-thresholds-signers-y-set-flags-se\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>4. Thresholds, Signers y Set Flags</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Seguridad y permisos</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Un punto fundamental en Stellar es la gestión de permisos. En este desafío, aprendimos a:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Configurar umbrales de firma, estableciendo la cantidad de firmas necesarias para transacciones de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>bajo, medio y alto riesgo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Agregar firmantes secundarios con </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Set Options</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Definir </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Trust Lines y Set Flags</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, estableciendo permisos sobre activos personalizados dentro del ecosistema.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"py-2\"><div class=\"twitter-wrapper mx-auto max-w-[520px]\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet text-center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Stellar_Chile/status/1892636186096623656\"><p>— #<!-- --> (#<!-- -->)<br></p></a></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://stellarchile.start.page\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"tr